> Hmm, and I'm not sure if the "ui" diphthong is OK in a fu'ivla; perhaps
> John or Lojbab could refresh my memory :-)

No problem.  "ai au ei oi" are legal in cmavo and lujvo; those plus
"ia ie ii io iu ua ue ui uo uu" are legal in fu'ivla and in attitudinal
cmavo; all those plus "uy iy" are legal in names.

